<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Doosan Beverage H1 net profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Doosan Beverage H1 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				    829 vs    1,025</p>
<p>    Net					   1.46 vs     1.31</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 2.56 vs     1.54</p>
<p>    Turnover				  261.26 vs   162.35</p>
<p>Note - Doosan Beverage Co is a South Korean beverage producer. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures but gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
